{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS安装包拉起可疑网络事件。对应需求：执行。官方：Suspicious Installer Package Spawns Network Event。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.network*","logs-endpoint.events.process*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS安装包拉起可疑网络事件","references":["https://redcanary.com/blog/clipping-silver-sparrows-wings","https://posts.specterops.io/introducing-mystikal-4fbd2f7ae520","https://github.com/D00MFist/Mystikal"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"99239e7d-b0d4-46e3-8609-acafcf99f68c","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"type":"eql","query":"sequence by host.id, process.entity_id with maxspan=15s\n[process where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action == \"exec\" and process.parent.name like~ (\"installer\", \"package_script_service\") and ((process.name in (\"bash\", \"sh\", \"zsh\") and process.args == \"-c\") or (process.name like~ (\"python*\", \"osascript\", \"tclsh*\", \"curl\", \"nscurl\")))]\n[network where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type == \"start\"]\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS安装包拉起可疑网络事件\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.002","name":"AppleScript","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/002/"},{"id":"T1059.004","name":"Unix Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/004/"},{"id":"T1059.006","name":"Python","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/006/"},{"id":"T1059.007","name":"JavaScript","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/007/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1071","name":"Application Layer Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1071.001","name":"Web Protocols","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/001/"}]},{"id":"T1105","name":"Ingress Tool Transfer","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1105/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}}],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":114,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
